                      "x": 312,
                      "y": 16,
                      "name": "Chat / Close Button / Default",
                      "context": "Close button for the chat panel (instance in Dashboard - Default example). 32×32 circle, $y:sem-chatBg fill, arrow-right-to-line icon in prim-blue-600. BORDER IS CONDITIONAL: render no outline at rest. Show the 1px prim-blue-300 border only when content scrolls beneath the button (e.g. messages passing under it) so it stays visually distinct from the content below; keep it borderless when only empty panel background is behind it.",
