                          "type": "frame",
                          "id": "Q5vjs",
                          "name": "chip1",
                          "context": "Prompt chip (default state). Pill-shaped suggestion button shown below the input field. Displays a pre-written financial question the user can tap to send. Font: Heebo 14, fill $y:sem-chatBg, border $y:sem-navBorder, radius $y:radius-md. States: default, hover, pressed.",
